      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但他们也对一直在沙土竞赛\n发挥实力的醒目飞鹰\n跑来参加草地竞赛表示质疑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d6a8a107f3c306eb4940ae42b07d9f56d5f34a99d61859a4128491052c9d798",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
