    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afcb76d4fed77013b044ee61",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰故做坚强，\n但还是难掩不安神情。\n于是训练员便为她送上了声援的打Call。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4426f190e40fe06b7d559cb4be170368d17d7683ac5027adb785ec2e2a31ff8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
