    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baceb2296bdd67917982876f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠的胜者舞台相当特别。\n醒目飞鹰为了拿下C位，\n朝赛场迈出了步伐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87d315d72ef72f2a68d247e49633e831b7ec9ec3520fd1ce1eb474c093d2274f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
