    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bec3ba04903986d50a3e92ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“日本沙土德比”当天。\n醒目飞鹰对自己擅长的沙土赛道\n展现了自信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77cc752731cf52aabfc31762203e49318b0c8f3d5b7df8067fd4e009229f7c62",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
