    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab736df56e220c1e26d80d6c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，开赛前的气氛有别于\n充满希望的“皋月赏”，今天的地下道出现了\n许多表情充满攻击性的参赛者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bce51323ea3c860859ae436678af16b12ef1ae78bf979310ed29f44dc0a20ec8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046411.json",
      "json_path": [
