    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58b77248f84cd127bae2c609",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无法在草地获胜的人；实力不足以\n挑战草地的人；以及被逼到绝境而\n抱着没有后路的想法参加沙土赛的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80331836a1a70d0f4b5c12136e07f8a9d6f948bad82670b4f4e9311bded0a60e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
