    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:240fcdd114ac71603862d9b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "周遭的赛马娘们尽是以“没有退路”的\n气魄去面对比赛。为了一鼓作气压制\n她们的气魄，醒目飞鹰走向了赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e9496ed139c7927d184bb8705864a603b3226903c1dc0482b2190d583ff50fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
