      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个东京赛场同时也是举行日本首屈一指的\n重要比赛“日本德比”的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d8349309b67763693e2cfc9ff19c2e7d491d3f1a8f62d55cd9b61cae3cdbd5c",
