      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目前的知名度还完全无法与德比较量。\n但醒目飞鹰还是迈向了赛场，打算取得胜利，\n让话题性延伸至下一场比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3ef5647e144ce40ccd34d9a00aba78952d0dc1bac982a771e80076f8ac8e3ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
