    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85c92d0b47dc056d64523bcc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰在发表宣言后，总是冷静地\n以胜利为目标。但她今天看起来有些呆滞，\n似乎缺乏专注力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94810d2413bf67c366bd1ea90cba09ac4959bd59a8229979b0dbda145a189985",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
