      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尽情绽放光芒吧。醒目飞鹰怀抱着\n十分珍贵的意念，走向了赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a348e26a671dab20c301d66f95cf7dae70437f2be070c9aa986b39ac39d2512",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
