    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a82ae4c7fde19c9a17b1410f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“东京大赏典”当天。大井赛场\n挤满了令人难以置信的大量观众。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22389ba595c87b09c86ecdb2499d621f049b96e65dd8641aef6cf5e8ab285498",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
