    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feb66a2c7a4fa3022ab1c43f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "由于回应醒目飞鹰心意的粉丝脚踏实地宣传，\n这里聚集了有史以来最多的观众，\n变成了最大的舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "873b6f097522c02f227b64c2733039f56e6f1c153233a562cb7caebd85a49e05",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046418.json",
      "json_path": [
