    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ab9669d7f5375d6e2cac1af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那就是在这个最棒的舞台上绽放光芒。\n为了成为顶尖赛马娘偶像，\n她要在最后的比赛中缔造完美结局。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1035afb1ff9177aa5ebc07a7e601402ab10b3e1c9aee527200a73912210a2597",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
