    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a71b7ef9efbefd2ca2426e7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "体会到在演唱会担任C位的喜悦后，\n她对顶尖赛马娘偶像的向往变得更加强烈了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b81a9220e3ef5a4cedb6014e8c08f95c2b960ad6ad6f82f7673bdd5caa2ceab4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0f779d8be0aabaff2cf6714",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想成为顶尖，就必须参加许多比赛，用演唱会\n吸引更多粉丝。这是赛马娘偶像该走的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a34caafcd9672a9428d3166eb234b6b1f72fd8c929aff1a6668e644679001ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1928883d62db57881f914a58",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然如此，目标就是在新马级\n取得超过两次胜利。\n要挑战Pre-OP以上的竞赛，提升知名度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "adf99ee1a22dd252aba0933a1ee93825c57d669e9165b78a5d4fcad584d44dc3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
